+
+' Router definition
+'
+' Note: In the resulting diagram, the router sits topologically outside all frames/networks,
+'       which in practice is not accurate. This is a limitation by PlantUML, as an object
+'       can't be nested under multiple other objects. In reality, the router will in fact
+'       belong to multiple networks.
+'
+' Format: node <router_identifier> <<router>>
+node central_router <<router>>
+
+' Role-to-role connections
+'
+' Format: <network_identifier>.<host_identifier>.<role_identifier> --> <network_identifier>.<host_identifier>.<role_identifier>
